    monsters excavated. Once per turn, during either player''s turn, when a card
    or effect is activated that would destroy a card(s) on the field: You can negate
    the effect, and if you do, destroy it. Once per turn, when an opponent''s monster
    declares an attack: You can target the attacking monster; banish this card, and
    if you do, negate that attack. During the next End Phase: Special Summon this
    card banished by this effect.'
